subject: fix(kiro): normalize Anthropic model ids onto Kiro upstream aliases

Map Anthropic model spellings and date snapshot suffixes to Kiro-accepted
aliases in resolveKiroModel(), and fix MiniMax casing to minimax-m2.5.


diff --git a/open-sse/config/kiroConstants.js b/open-sse/config/kiroConstants.js
